// "<ability>. Activate only <timing>, only <limit>, only if <guard>." and the
// like: the restrictions a keyword or a granting effect adds to an ability
// [CR#113.10a]. The guard reads "as long as", "this ability triggers only if"
// or "activate only if" by the wrapped ability's category
// [CR#702.169b..702.169d]; `from` is the zone it functions from [CR#113.6b].
(
    name: "qualified",
    kinds: [Ability],
    params: {
        "ability": Ability,
        "timing": Default(Any, None),
        "limit": Default(Any, None),
        "guard": Default(Any, None),
        "from": Default(Any, None),
    },
    body: Qualified(Param(ability), Param(timing), Param(limit), Param(guard), Param(from)),
)
